sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AP as Named approver
    participant PR as Product
    participant OP as Compliance operator
    participant VA as Credential vault
    participant EP as EPFO portal
    participant OT as OTP contact
    participant PY as Employer payer
    PR->>AP: ECR artefact, diff and exclude-and-flag list
    AP->>PR: Approves the artefact in product
    PR->>OP: Session READY, chronology and pre-checks passed
    OP->>VA: Checks out the credential for this PF code
    VA-->>OP: Credential injected into the workspace, never displayed
    OP->>EP: Signs in, operator solves the CAPTCHA
    EP-->>OT: OTP, only if the portal prompts
    OT->>OP: Relays the OTP through the product prompt
    OP->>EP: Uploads file, enters Wage Month, Return Type, Rate, Remark
    EP-->>OP: Validation result and return statement
    OP->>PR: Captures the return statement
    PR->>AP: Line-by-line reconciliation, instruction requested
    AP->>PR: Instructs approval, bound to the statement hash
    OP->>EP: Approves the return, now non-cancellable
    EP-->>OP: Due Deposit Balance Summary with 7Q interest
    OP->>PR: Captures the summary
    PR->>AP: Verification gate result, instruction requested
    AP->>PR: Instructs the challan, bound to the summary hash
    OP->>EP: Generates the challan with TRRN
    OP->>VA: Checks the credential in, hands payment over
    PY->>EP: Pays the TRRN challan on own bank authentication
    EP-->>PY: Payment receipt
    PY->>PR: Receipt imported, or fetched in a short evidence session
    PR->>PR: Reconciles and records FILED
    Note over AP,PY: From payment initiation a Revised return is impossible - EV-037
